  "notes": [
    "Live REA stdio MCP over the main+DllBattle carrier (analyses and byte reads in session outputs/rea-battle-7); every instruction word and literal equals the original DllBattle.cro bytes except the checked ABS32 relocations.",
    "Six handlers have no Ghidra function; their listings come from ../battle_power/reproduction/decode_arm.py, which reproduces every supported REA-listed instruction. 1084aee8 falls through into 1084aeec (reconstructed in battle_moves_3). Ghidra lists 1084aef8 (battle_moves_3) as a second body range of 108c21dc. The six hook literals are ABS32 relocations to code addresses, whose original words and S+A values are checked.",
    "Static analysis plus host comparison; not a matching original build."
